          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-secondary flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>TL;DR: Quick Summary</h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-2 text-sm">
